  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">E4D/SOGA Employment and skills for Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme to promote skills development and enterprise development in Kenya, Mozambique, Tanzania, Uganda and Ghana. The E4D programme aims to provide young men and women with job opportunities through relevant vocational training and job creation. There is a special focus on including girls and young women in training and employment.</narrative>
  </description>
